{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01154","headline":"相和歌辞 长歌续短歌 · 李贺","name":"相和歌辞 长歌续短歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长歌破衣襟，短歌断白发。\n秦王不可见，旦夕成内热。\n渴饮壶中酒，饥拔陇头粟。\n凄凄四月兰，千里一时绿。\n夜峰何离离，月明落石底。\n裴回沿石寻，照出高峰外。\n不得与之游，歌成鬓先改。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}